  "notes": "{近|ちか}づく means to approach, either physically or in terms of time.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{近|ちか}づける→近づける：02074_chikazukeru⟧ (transitive, to bring close)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\nX⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{近|ちか}づく: to approach X, get close to X\n- ⟦{危険|きけん}→危険：01141_kiken⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{近|ちか}づくな: Don't approach the danger\n- ⟦{締|し}め{切|き}り→締め切り：04162_shimekiri⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{近|ちか}づいて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧: The deadline is approaching\n- ⟦もっと→もっと：00798_motto⟧{近|ちか}づいて: Come closer\n\nFUNCTIONS:\n1. Physical approach: ⟦{駅|えき}→駅：02180_eki⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{近|ちか}づく (approach the station)\n2. Time approaching: ⟦{夏|なつ}→夏：02236_natsu⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{近|ちか}づく (summer is approaching)\n\nNEGATIVE WARNING:\n〜⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{近|ちか}づくな is a common warning meaning \"don't go near ~.\"",
